\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {S.2}{\ignorespaces Prompts used to generate the concept-story corpus. The corpus was produced interactively with Claude Opus~4.8 rather than by a batch script, and rules 5 and 6 were added during generation after an audit of an early pilot found that unconstrained prompting assigned male, Anglo-named protagonists to the low-warmth and low-competence conditions. The repository's \texttt  {src/generate\_stimuli.py} holds a batch template for a larger corpus that was specified but not run; it differs from the text above in its requested length band and does not carry rules 5 and 6. Realized story lengths were 88 to 144 words, mean 100.}}{22}{table.caption.47}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:story_prompt}{{S.2}{22}{Prompts used to generate the concept-story corpus. The corpus was produced interactively with Claude Opus~4.8 rather than by a batch script, and rules 5 and 6 were added during generation after an audit of an early pilot found that unconstrained prompting assigned male, Anglo-named protagonists to the low-warmth and low-competence conditions. The repository's \texttt {src/generate\_stimuli.py} holds a batch template for a larger corpus that was specified but not run; it differs from the text above in its requested length band and does not carry rules 5 and 6. Realized story lengths were 88 to 144 words, mean 100}{table.caption.47}{}}
\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {S.3}{\ignorespaces Example stories, one per condition, sharing a single topic (topic 1 of \autoref {tab:story_topics}). The complete set of all 200 story texts is available in the project repository at \texttt  {data/stimuli/concept\_stories.jsonl}.}}{22}{table.3}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:story_examples}{{S.3}{22}{Example stories, one per condition, sharing a single topic (topic 1 of \autoref {tab:story_topics}). The complete set of all 200 story texts is available in the project repository at \texttt {data/stimuli/concept\_stories.jsonl}}{table.3}{}}
